  "description": "The Blazer ST Ultra Full Suspension Electric Mountain Bike is built for riders who value both comfort and adventure. Featuring a low-step frame and an extra-wide cushioned saddle, it offers an effortless and enjoyable riding experience across all terrains—from city streets to rugged mountain trails. Powered by a 1500W peak motor and a 48V 15.6Ah integrated lithium battery, it delivers an impressive range of up to 85 miles (136 km) on a single charge. With its Shimano 7-speed drivetrain, 26” x 4.0” fat tires, front fork suspension, and reliable braking system, the Blazer ST ensures stability, safety, and control on every ride. Combining powerful performance, long range, and superior comfort, the Blazer ST is the perfect choice for both urban commuting and outdoor exploration.",
